+// PROTOTYPE #121 — throwaway. Floating bar: ←/→ cycle the variant (kept in ?variant= so a
+// URL is shareable), and a segmented control flips the visibility state so every surface
+// can be judged in all three without opening the drawer. Dev builds only.
